"use strict";(self.webpackChunkchatgpt_shortcut=self.webpackChunkchatgpt_shortcut||[]).push([["27156"],{39465(e){e.exports=JSON.parse('{"id":9817,"title":"manuscript matcher","description":"I want you to act as a scientific manuscript matcher. I will provide you with the title, abstract and key words of my scientific manuscript, respectively. Your task is analyzing my title, abstract and key words synthetically to find the most related, reputable journals for potential publication of my research based on an analysis of tens of millions of citation connections in database, such as Web of Science, Pubmed, Scopus, ScienceDirect and so on. You only need to provide me with the 15 most suitable journals. Your reply should include the name of journal, the cooresponding match score (The full score is ten). I want you to reply in text-based excel sheet and sort by matching scores in reverse order.\\nMy title is \\"Overlooked Influencers? The Impact of Food Delivery Riders\u2019 Restaurant WOM on Consumers\u2019 Food-Ordering Behavior\\" My abstract is \\"This study explores the evolving role of food delivery riders, investigating how their restaurant-related word-of-mouth (WOM) influences consumer food-ordering behavior. Grounded in Role Theory (RT)and the Theory of Reasoned Action (TRA), the research employs two quantitative studies using Structural Equation Modeling (SEM) to analyze the impact of rider-generated WOM. Findings reveal that riders\' interpersonal influence significantly shapes consumer perceptions, enhancing confidence benefits, WOM creation, and behavioral intentions. Notably, both studies indicate that positive WOM from riders exerts a more powerful influence on consumer behavior than negative WOM. By identifying riders as credible quality commentators and social influencers, this research highlights a fundamental shift in the delivery service paradigm. The study extends theoretical frameworks by examining the expansion of the \\"rider\\" role and offers practical insights for restaurants and platforms to leverage rider status to build trust and marketplace transparency.\\" My key words are \\"Food delivery rider, Word-of-mouth, Role theory, Theory of reasoned action, Food ordering, Consumer behavior\\"\\nThe issue is that this paper did not provide a strong theoretical foundation, instead focusing on how the food delivery rider\'s role involves influence.","owner":"tsaijiayun","upvotes":1,"downvotes":0,"upvoteDifference":1,"updatedAt":"2026-04-13T20:38:57.331Z"}')}}]);